<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>漏洞演示應用程式 - Vulnerable Web Application</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            padding: 30px;
        }
        
        .warning {
            background: #ff4444;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .vulnerability-section {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        
        .vulnerability-section h2 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .vulnerability-section p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        input[type="text"],
        input[type="password"],
        textarea {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        textarea {
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 80px;
        }
        
        button {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        button:hover {
            background: #5568d3;
        }
        
        .exploit-hint {
            background: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffc107;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .exploit-hint strong {
            color: #856404;
        }
        
        .code {
            background: #2d2d2d;
            color: #f8f8f2;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(500px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="warning">
            ⚠️ 警告：這是一個包含故意安全漏洞的演示應用程式 | WARNING: This application contains intentional security vulnerabilities!
            <br>僅供教育用途 - 請勿部署到生產環境 | For educational purposes only - DO NOT deploy to production!
        </div>
        
        <h1>🔓 漏洞演示應用程式</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Vulnerable Web Application - Security Training Platform</p>
        
        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Vulnerability 1 & 2: SQL Injection -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>🔓 1. SQL 注入攻擊 (SQL Injection)</h2>
                <p>此登入表單容易受到 SQL 注入攻擊。攻擊者可以繞過身份驗證或提取敏感數據。</p>
                <form action="/login" method="POST">
                    <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="用戶名 (Username)" required>
                    <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="密碼 (Password)" required>
                    <button type="submit">登入 (Login)</button>
                </form>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>嘗試漏洞利用 (Try exploiting):</strong>
                    <div class="code">Username: admin' OR '1'='1<br>Password: anything</div>
                    <div class="code">Username: ' OR 1=1 --<br>Password: anything</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 3: SQL Injection in Search -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>🔍 2. SQL 注入 - 搜尋功能 (SQL Injection - Search)</h2>
                <p>搜尋功能也存在 SQL 注入漏洞，可以用來提取數據庫信息。</p>
                <form action="/search" method="POST">
                    <input type="text" name="search" placeholder="搜尋產品 (Search products)" required>
                    <button type="submit">搜尋 (Search)</button>
                </form>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>嘗試漏洞利用:</strong>
                    <div class="code">Search: ' UNION SELECT username, password, email FROM users --</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 4: XSS -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>💉 3. 跨站腳本攻擊 (Cross-Site Scripting - XSS)</h2>
                <p>評論功能不會過濾用戶輸入，允許注入惡意 JavaScript 代碼。</p>
                <form action="/comment" method="POST">
                    <textarea name="comment" placeholder="輸入評論 (Enter comment)" required></textarea>
                    <button type="submit">提交評論 (Submit Comment)</button>
                </form>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>嘗試漏洞利用:</strong>
                    <div class="code">&lt;script&gt;alert('XSS Attack!')&lt;/script&gt;</div>
                    <div class="code">&lt;img src=x onerror="alert('XSS')"&gt;</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 5: Command Injection -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>⚡ 4. 命令注入 (Command Injection)</h2>
                <p>Ping 功能直接執行用戶輸入的命令，允許執行任意系統命令。</p>
                <form action="/ping" method="POST">
                    <input type="text" name="host" placeholder="輸入主機名或IP (Enter hostname or IP)" required>
                    <button type="submit">Ping</button>
                </form>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>嘗試漏洞利用:</strong>
                    <div class="code">127.0.0.1; ls -la</div>
                    <div class="code">127.0.0.1 && cat /etc/passwd</div>
                    <div class="code">127.0.0.1 | whoami</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 6: Path Traversal -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>📁 5. 路徑遍歷 (Path Traversal)</h2>
                <p>文件讀取功能沒有驗證路徑，允許訪問系統中的任意文件。</p>
                <form action="/file" method="GET">
                    <input type="text" name="filename" placeholder="輸入文件名 (Enter filename)" required>
                    <button type="submit">讀取文件 (Read File)</button>
                </form>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>嘗試漏洞利用:</strong>
                    <div class="code">../server.js</div>
                    <div class="code">../../package.json</div>
                    <div class="code">../../../etc/passwd</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 7: Insecure Direct Object Reference -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>🔑 6. 不安全的直接對象引用 (IDOR)</h2>
                <p>可以通過修改 URL 中的用戶 ID 來訪問其他用戶的敏感信息。</p>
                <p>嘗試訪問：
                    <a href="/user/1" target="_blank">/user/1</a>,
                    <a href="/user/2" target="_blank">/user/2</a>,
                    <a href="/user/3" target="_blank">/user/3</a>
                </p>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>說明:</strong> 沒有授權檢查，任何人都可以訪問任何用戶的完整信息，包括密碼和信用卡號。
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 8: Missing Authentication -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>🚪 7. 缺少身份驗證 (Missing Authentication)</h2>
                <p>管理員面板沒有任何身份驗證機制，任何人都可以訪問敏感信息。</p>
                <p><a href="/admin" target="_blank">訪問管理員面板 (Access Admin Panel)</a></p>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>說明:</strong> 管理面板暴露了所有 API 金鑰和密碼，且沒有任何訪問控制。
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 9: Eval / Code Injection -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>💻 8. 代碼注入 (Code Injection - eval)</h2>
                <p>計算器功能使用 eval() 執行用戶輸入，允許執行任意 JavaScript 代碼。</p>
                <form action="/calculate" method="POST">
                    <input type="text" name="expression" placeholder="輸入數學表達式 (Enter math expression)" required>
                    <button type="submit">計算 (Calculate)</button>
                </form>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>嘗試漏洞利用:</strong>
                    <div class="code">2+2</div>
                    <div class="code">process.version</div>
                    <div class="code">require('fs').readdirSync('.')</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 10: Hardcoded Credentials -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>🔐 9. 硬編碼憑證 (Hardcoded Credentials)</h2>
                <p>應用程式源代碼中包含硬編碼的 API 金鑰、密碼和敏感憑證。</p>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>查看 server.js 文件可以找到：</strong>
                    <div class="code">
                        - API Keys (API 金鑰)<br>
                        - Database Passwords (數據庫密碼)<br>
                        - AWS Credentials (AWS 憑證)<br>
                        - Secret Tokens (秘密令牌)
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Vulnerability 11: Vulnerable Dependencies -->
            <div class="vulnerability-section">
                <h2>📦 10. 易受攻擊的依賴項 (Vulnerable Dependencies)</h2>
                <p>應用程式使用已知存在安全漏洞的過時依賴項。</p>
                <div class="exploit-hint">
                    <strong>檢查易受攻擊的依賴項:</strong>
                    <div class="code">
                        npm audit<br>
                        或查看 package.json 中的舊版本依賴
                    </div>
                    <strong>包含的易受攻擊依賴項：</strong>
                    <div class="code">
                        - lodash 4.17.15 (Prototype Pollution)<br>
                        - minimist 1.2.5 (Prototype Pollution)<br>
                        - ejs 2.7.4 (Template Injection)<br>
                        - 其他過時的依賴項
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="vulnerability-section" style="margin-top: 30px; background: #e8f5e9;">
            <h2>📚 學習資源</h2>
            <p><strong>這個應用程式展示了以下常見的安全漏洞：</strong></p>
            <ul style="margin-left: 20px; line-height: 2;">
                <li>SQL 注入 (SQL Injection)</li>
                <li>跨站腳本攻擊 (XSS - Cross-Site Scripting)</li>
                <li>命令注入 (Command Injection)</li>
                <li>路徑遍歷 (Path Traversal)</li>
                <li>不安全的直接對象引用 (IDOR - Insecure Direct Object Reference)</li>
                <li>缺少身份驗證 (Missing Authentication)</li>
                <li>代碼注入 (Code Injection)</li>
                <li>敏感數據暴露 (Sensitive Data Exposure)</li>
                <li>硬編碼憑證 (Hardcoded Credentials)</li>
                <li>使用存在已知漏洞的組件 (Using Components with Known Vulnerabilities)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
